

What is File class?
java.io.File represents file or directory path
It does NOT read or write data
Used for:
    creating files/folders
    checking existence
    getting file info (name, size, permissions)
👉 Think of File as file metadata manager, not data handler.



-> Important Methods

| Method                     | Purpose           |
| -------------------------- | ----------------- |
| `createNewFile()`          | Create file       |
| `exists()`                 | Check existence   |
| `mkdir()`                  | Create directory  |
| `getName()`                | File name         |
| `getAbsolutePath()`        | Full path         |
| `length()`                 | File size (bytes) |
| `canRead()` / `canWrite()` | Permissions       |
